-- synopsis

---more
Admittedly simpler than other ones, mostly because I spent a bunch of time setting up Reaper (DAW) and integrating a live instrument, my impulsively purchased bass.
In theory would be cool for a live performance, but I don’t have enough sound equipment or loop pedals for that.
